  <item>
    <title>复活季003-6月屋米荐影</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6677c276b6a8412729ab30a1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6677c276b6a8412729ab30a1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Jun 2024 06:36:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家暑期快乐~!这期我们开启了新主题-建筑师的电影推荐!</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 本期主播:</span><br><span>建筑师高克凡(小宇宙@米高克凡)</span><br><span>建筑师大威子(小红书@大威子)</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 进度条提要:</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a> 《冰上轻驰Cool Runnings》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="782">13:02</a> 《僧侣和枪 The Monk And The Gun》 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 《处刑人The Boondock Saints》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> 美国六月节解放黑奴纪念日简介</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> 斯皮尔伯格解放黑奴冷门片《勇者无惧Amistad》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 斯皮尔伯格黑人女性女权主义冷门片《紫色The Color Purple》</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 本期电影的海报和补充信息:</span><br><span>1. 《冰上轻驰Cool Runnings》</span><br><span>电影海报：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmLxR7-XM0ZeXBCOmoSyQvf4rayL.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>真实事件的主人公：牙买加传奇运动员+音乐人小山姆·克莱顿</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgQ3ZpuEhhrw4oeB5YfZB3Qwszgk.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2. 《僧侣和枪 The Monk And The Gun》电影海报：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoNdtjcoMYTIb4B6WCn8gB3cmt6f.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>不丹的僧人：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmK_wZBt1eJxY-Yv_m7n7kKW8OwJ.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>BIG的不丹城市规划概念方案：“正念之城”，</span><br><span>详戳：</span><a href="https://www.archiposition.com/items/556f794563" data-url="https://www.archiposition.com/items/556f794563"><span>BIG最新城市规划：不丹未来“正念之城”</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlyTkweENWuUE4yLtwdtiuBb6gfQ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>3. 《处刑人1 The Boondock Saints》电影海报：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu7uHmE40S-CVxOO34CjZWt6r82M.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>威廉·达福（Willem Dafoe）在片中神级演